              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lapho bebiza inkosi, u-Eliyakimi indodana kaHilikiya owayephezu kwendlu waphuma waya kubo noShebina unobhala noJowaki indodana ka-Asafa umbusi.",
          "type": "text",
